<title>GREECE: IONIAN BANK ATM NETWORK DOWN FRI-SAT.</title>
<headline>IONIAN BANK ATM NETWORK DOWN FRI-SAT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank said works on its computer centre will affect its ATM network countrywide. It will be down from Friday evening (23:00) until Saturday morning (05:00), it said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
